# terra: this machine carries no repo fleet — only the toolbox itself.
#
# Unlike every other kind in the repo, terra does NOT layer on top of
# repos.common.conf: that file lists the shared `ai` checkouts, and a machine
# on the terra profile is one that deliberately holds nothing but this toolbox.
# repo-sync.sh special-cases the concatenation for this profile.
#
# Copy to repos.terra.conf (gitignored).
. platypeeps/system-tools
